  displayName: Vrask Siege Group
  kind: 7
  description: 'A Vrask Maw and two Skinks on station 160 km over Port Ochre, besieging the city: every two hours its spinal artillery shells the city''s defences and then its buildings, and now and then it sends a nuclear missile down that wipes the city out for eight hours. Its guns open up on a ship within 12 km; its artillery on one its escorts can see. Destroy the Maw to stop the raids (the Vrask send another in half an hour).'
